# Operations

The ALU supports the following operations:

| Operation | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
|  ADD      | Addition    |
|  SUB      | Subtraction |
|  AND      | Bitwise AND |
|  OR       | Bitwise OR  |
|  XOR      | Bitwise XOR |
|  SHL      | Shift left  |
|  SHR      | Shift right |
|  CMP      | Compare     |

